  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When creating or replacing a NonRDFSource in Fedora (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/a2ec2ac5b273670c421b74df1ad9174b3289f663/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraLdp.java#L440C21-L440C45"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraLdp.java#L440C21-L440C45",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "),  the database connections needs to stay open for a long time without any activity because the binary stream (more than 100 gigabytes) is being read within the database transaction (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/a2ec2ac5b273670c421b74df1ad9174b3289f663/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraLdp.java#L560C1-L560C48"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraLdp.java#L560C1-L560C48",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "). The largest files we can ingest is thus proportional to the time the database transaction can be kept open.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A stack trace of the problem can be found here: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "collection": "",
        "id": "d7de4591-47b1-4fb3-99ab-7f805b6042b3",
        "type": "file"
       },
       "type": "mediaInline"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Code location where the binary stream is actually read:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/AbstractNonRdfSourcePersister.java#L89"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Wich is called in these 2 locations:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "attrs": {
            "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/CreateNonRdfSourcePersister.java#L46"
           },
           "type": "inlineCard"
          },
          {
           "text": " ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "attrs": {
            "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-persistence-ocfl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/persistence/ocfl/impl/UpdateNonRdfSourcePersister.java#L59"
           },
           "type": "inlineCard"
          },
          {
           "text": " ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Proposal: Make the database transactions shorter by fetching the binaries content outside of the transaction.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Our cloud setup:\n\nFedora\n- Version: 6.5.0\n- keepaliveTime=30sec\n\nPostgres:\n- Version: 12.16\n- Custom settings: idle_in_transaction_session_timeout=180 minutes\n\nDeployed as a docker stack. The database container is in endpoint_mode: dnsrr and the port is in mode: host\n\nOur customers environments can differ and our mostly running on Windows servers.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
